('university', 'CS224N · Natural Language Processing with Deep Learning', 'Stanford University', 'Deep dive into NLP and LLMs — word vectors, transformers, BERT, GPT, RLHF, agents, and RAG. Full 2024 lecture playlist freely available on YouTube.', 'material', 'Advanced', '["stanford","nlp","llm","transformers","rlhf","free"]', '["Video + Slides","Advanced"]', 'https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLoROMvodv4rOaMFbaqxPDoLWjDaRAdP9D', 0),
